---
description: Living portfolio implementation rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Build this portfolio as a premium, data-driven personal site.

Use shadcn/ui as the component foundation.

Do not hardcode portfolio content into components when it belongs in `src/data/`.

Source narrative copy from `obsidian/tintinportfolio/` when updating content.

Weekly experience direction is controlled through `src/generated/creative-direction.json`, `src/generated/theme.json`, `src/generated/interaction-system.json`, and CSS variables.

Weekly generation runs via Cursor Automation (`creative-direction/agent-runbook.md`). CI validates only. Never let the weekly agent edit `src/components/**` or content files.

The hero section is the main experimental canvas. Navigation and content must remain stable.

Case studies are teaser-only on the public site.

No manual dark mode toggle — weekly creative direction tokens only.
